{"hymn":"S428","parent":"E542","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Las riquezas de mi Cristo","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Sus riquezas","syl":{"n1":"Las","n2":["ri","i"],"n3":["que","m"],"n4":["zas","t"],"n5":"de","n6":"mi","n7":["Cris","i"],"n8":["to,","t"],"n9":["Ple","i"],"n10":["ni","m"],"n11":["tud","t"],"n12":"de","n13":"la","n14":["Dei","i"],"n15":["dad;","t"],"n16":["Aun","i"],"n17":["que","t"],"n18":"son","n19":["i","i"],"n20":["nes","m"],"n21":["cru","m"],"n22":["ta","m"],"n23":["bles,","t"],"n24":"Hoy","n25":"las","n26":["pue","i"],"n27":["do","t"],"n28":["dis","i"],"n29":["fru","m"],"n30":["tar.","t"],"n31":"¡Las","n32":["ri","i"],"n33":["que","m"],"n34":["zas!","t"],"n35":"¡Las","n36":["ri","i"],"n37":["que","m"],"n38":["zas!","t"],"n39":"Que","n40":"mi","n41":["Sal","i"],"n42":["va","m"],"n43":["dor","t"],"n44":"me","n45":"da,","n46":["¡In","i"],"n47":["con","m"],"n48":["ta","m"],"n49":["ble‿es","t"],"n50":"su","n51":["me","i"],"n52":["di","m"],"n53":["da,","t"],"n54":"Mas","n55":"mi","n56":["ple","i"],"n57":["na","t"],"n58":["rea","i"],"n59":["li","m"],"n60":["dad!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Las riquezas de mi Cristo,","Todo‿abarcan: vida‿y luz,","Sanidad, poder, consuelo,","¡Qué tesoros! ¡Qué virtud!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Por la redención divina","Y completa salvación,","Santifica, glorifica,","Su vital resurrección."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Las riquezas de mi Cristo,","Son el todo de mi Dios;","Su persona‿y posesiones","En mi‿espíritu‿infundió."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Las riquezas de mi Cristo,","¡Qué anchura‿y longitud,","Qué profundidad y‿altura!","Mas mi gozo‿y plenitud."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Que conozca las riquezas","De mi Cristo‿en realidad;","Que comparta yo con otros","Toda su inmensidad."]}]}